ENGTH - 2] = '\\0';\n58\t    error->text[JSON_ERROR_TEXT_LENGTH - 1] = code;\n59\t}\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01EdnqDCfgUXsbk9RDJNQYrp","session_id":"e1728859-25d0-4463-adf4-96231e8435a5","uuid":"a57b97c3-2f64-41ec-b82e-619ec9bf4f75","timestamp":"2026-08-31T03:40:40.527Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Derive CONFIGS.md from C source"}
