ENGTH - 2] = '\\0';\n58\t    error->text[JSON_ERROR_TEXT_LENGTH - 1] = code;\n59\t}\n60\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01AUGs4XrNvJdumYk7FPdzeQ","session_id":"e1728859-25d0-4463-adf4-96231e8435a5","uuid":"744facf1-0e74-4bb8-ba34-4630cc66c967","timestamp":"2026-08-31T03:46:32.274Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"CONFIGS part 3: low-level modules"}
