olumn/position `-1/-1/0` | [ ] |\n| 228 | `json_pack` | `\"n\"` alone → the null singleton; `\"b\"` with vararg `int` 0 → `json_false()`, with 1 and with 2 → `json_true()`; assert singleton pointer identity | [ ] |\n---","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01Q17JdGMpf71YmhvBG8Hx7e","session_id":"e1728859-25d0-4463-adf4-96231e8435a5","uuid":"a97f1e8c-08ac-4d23-b75d-19147b0ddb28","timestamp":"2026-08-31T03:56:17.041Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Phase B tests for value.c"}
