error — the first `n` fails the type check first. That case was removed from the row-254 list with a comment.\n\n### Non-vacuity validation\nTwo rounds of deliberately injected bugs in `pack_unpack.rs`, then reverted:\n- Round 1 (`json_error_index_out_of_range`→`wrong_type`; drop the `'*'` value-modifier guard in `pack_object`/`pack_array`; always use `<unknown>` for the strict key list) → **7 tests failed**, including a case where *only* the code byte differed (17 vs 10), proving the code-byte channel works.\n- Round 2 (`+1` on the reported column in `set_error_with`; `\"<format>\"`→`\"<fmt>\"` on the NULL-format path) → **27 of 32 tests failed**, proving the line/column/position and source channels are load-bearing.\n\nBoth rounds reverted; `src/` byte-identical to its original state."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":321,"cache_read_input_tokens":296156,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":321,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_013ioknR3uh5BBsa6ebVj2DJ","session_id":"e1728859-25d0-4463-adf4-96231e8435a5","uuid":"d8307114-8e09-457f-bac5-f5a801237623","timestamp":"2026-08-31T05:35:58.741Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Phase C error tests for pack_unpack"}
